Ceap
$cards
DECK 1 SPADES

$initial
IPAEY 10 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
IPAEY 3 FACE_HALF

$moves
MOVE IPAEY IPAEY
OR
    AND
        DESTSRC Rank add_14
        SRC Rank 1
    AND
        SRC Rank K
        DESTSRC Rank equal
MOVE_STACK IPAEY IPAEY
DEST Rank K
$win
AND
    PILE ALL IPAEY Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL IPAEY Empty
        PILE ALL IPAEY Empty
